{"id":"n54090-1-4","stage":4,"title":"떨치다 · 抖","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n54090-1-4-1","ko":"왜 갑자기 몸을 흔들고 그래?","zh":"怎么突然这样晃动身体？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"몸을","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸을","audio":"/audio/384974e1d9816572ab28.mp3"}},{"text":"흔들고","meaning":"摇动，摇晃，挥动","explanation":"흔들다：摇动，摇晃，挥动；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"흔들다","audio":"/audio/7a1c6daa46f2de7e8fda.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29776","senseId":"1","lemma":"흔들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흔들고","audio":"/audio/106a4b521d263636cf73.mp3"}},{"text":"그래?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"7a1c6daa46f2de7e","term":"흔들다","zh":"摇动，摇晃，挥动","audio":"/audio/7a1c6daa46f2de7e8fda.mp3","entryId":"29776","definition":"使某物左右或前后摆动。","pronunciation":["흔들다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/b53da3a3d12848dd06df.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n54090-1-4-2","ko":"어깨에 앉은 벌레를 떨치려고.","zh":"想把落在肩膀上的虫子甩掉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어깨에","meaning":"肩，肩膀","explanation":"어깨：肩，肩膀；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어깨","audio":"/audio/7881b57e7d18b91acaf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29970","senseId":"1","lemma":"어깨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어깨에","audio":"/audio/50f337000991afad35c2.mp3"}},{"text":"앉은","meaning":"坐落，着落，停","explanation":"앉다：坐落，着落，停；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"2","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앉은","audio":"/audio/b98c95bcfcd444b7b080.mp3"}},{"text":"벌레를","meaning":"虫子","explanation":"벌레：虫子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"벌레","audio":"/audio/ee023753239e5ca14bd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59098","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌레","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌레를","audio":"/audio/c61ac0bc4fa515df6d6f.mp3"}},{"text":"떨치려고.","meaning":"抖，掸","explanation":"떨치다：抖，掸；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"떨치다","audio":"/audio/ad39c70cda58fcd6737b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54090","senseId":"1","lemma":"떨치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨치려고","audio":"/audio/a55cc59af8359754b579.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7881b57e7d18b91a","term":"어깨","zh":"肩，肩膀","audio":"/audio/7881b57e7d18b91acaf0.mp3","entryId":"29970","definition":"从脖子下端到胳膊上端的身体的一部分。","pronunciation":["어깨"]},{"id":"17e77d3fb6b2dbdb","term":"앉다","zh":"坐落，着落，停","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3","entryId":"71463","definition":"飞行的动物或飞机落到一定地方，将自己身体放在别的物体上。","pronunciation":["안따"]},{"id":"ee023753239e5ca1","term":"벌레","zh":"虫子","audio":"/audio/ee023753239e5ca14bd3.mp3","entryId":"59098","definition":"昆虫或寄生虫等身体结构简单的动物。","pronunciation":["벌레"]},{"id":"ad39c70cda58fcd6","term":"떨치다","zh":"抖，掸","audio":"/audio/ad39c70cda58fcd6737b.mp3","entryId":"54090","definition":"用力晃动使掉落。","pronunciation":["떨치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/36c803d27328dc9d393f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.633,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=54090","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":129,"sequenceScore":2.4597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["想把落在肩膀上的虫子甩掉。","怎么突然这样晃动身体？","你没事吧？没受伤吧？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["怎么突然这样晃动身体？","你没事吧？没受伤吧？","想把落在肩膀上的虫子甩掉。"],"answer":2}]}
